G["Barring stray boulders from those giants, we should be clear... it seems a mess down there though."]="Salvo pelas pedras desviadas desses gigantes, deveria estar abriu... embora aquilo de baixo parece um desastre."
G["Bartlett the Brave has set up gryphon roosts here in town.  If you're looking to take a ride, then talk to him."]="Bartlett, o Bravo, instalou ninhos de grifos aqui na cidade. Caso queira viajar, fale com ele."
G["Bash it!"]="Ao ataque!"
G["Basilisk"]="Basilisco"
G["Bask in my radiance!"]="Deleitaos na minha resplandor!"
G["Bastard."]="Bastardo."
G["Bastia, let's ride!"]="Vamos, Bastia!"
G["Bastoon! Humiliate the interlopers."]="Bastún! Humilha aos intrusos."
G["Bat man on upper level of Trade Quarter."]="Morcego no nível superior do Trade Quarter."
G["Bathe in the flaming blood of the earth!"]="Sumérgete na sangue ardente da terra!"
G["Bathrobes with integrated shower-nozzles."]="Albornoces com boca de ducha incorporada."
G["Battle Goats GO!"]="ADIANTE kabras de batalha!"
