G["Collecting Supplies"]="Reunir provisiones"
G["Collection of bandages is proceeding according to schedule. As far as linen bandages are concerned, we've gathered $2076w of $2077w. Silk bandages have been tallied at $2082w out of $2083w, and we have $2088w out of $2090w runecloth bandages needed."]="A pegue de ataduras está ocorrendo de acordo com o cronograma. No que diz respeito às bandagens de linho, reunimos $2076w de $2077w. As ataduras de seda foram calculadas em $2082w de $2083w, e nós temos $2088w de $2090w necessários para ataduras de pano de correr."
G["Combat matrix overload. Powering doooow..."]="Sobrecarga da matriz de combate. Desligandooooo..."
G["Combined with evil's ointment, the bell's evil can be undone."]="Com unguento maligno, para com a maldade do sino acabar."
G["Come ON, Uncle Chen! What are we waiting for?"]="Vamos, tio Chen! A que estamos esperando?"
G["Come aboard, now. Step on up!"]="Todos a bordo. Cima!"
G["Come aboard, now. Step right up!"]="Todos a bordo. Cima!"
G["Come again."]="Volte novamente."
