G["Elder Stormbrow is most likely at the village of Goldshire in Elwynn Forest."]="O Élder Stormbrow provavelmente está na vila de Goldshire, na Floresta de Elwynn."
G["Elder Tauros found his way to Zim'Torga in Zul'Drak."]="O Élder Tauros chegou a Zim'Torga em Zul'Drak."
G["Elder Thoim has spent many years at Moa'ki Harbor in Dragonblight."]="O Élder Thoim passou muitos anos no Porto Moa'ki, no Ermo das Serpes."
