G["Tell me when you are ready and we will go!|TInterface\\GossipFrame\\GOSSIPGOSSIPICON.blp:32|t"]="Avise-me quando estiver $gpronto: pronta; e começaremos! |TInterface\\GossipFrame\\GOSSIPGOSSIPICON.blp:32|t"
