G["The Horde has lost control of the Draenei Ruins!"]="A Horda perdeu as Ruínas Draeneis!"
G["The Horde has lost control of the Fel Reaver Ruins!"]="A Horda perdeu as Ruínas do Assaltante Vil!"
G["The Horde has lost control of the Mage Tower!"]="A Horda perdeu o controle da Torre dos Magos!"
G["The Horde has lost control of the Stoneward Prison!"]="A Horda perdeu o controle da Prisão Guardapétrea!"
